---
---
<div class="announce">
  <div class="container announce-inner">
    <p>Ideas, innovations and perspectives shaping our world.</p>
    <a href="/#latest">Read the latest <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .announce { background: var(--c-navy); color: #fff; font-size: var(--t-xs); }
  .announce-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    padding-block: var(--s-2);
  }
  .announce a { font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0.9; transition: opacity var(--ease); }
  .announce a:hover { opacity: 1; text-decoration: underline; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .announce p { display: none; } .announce-inner { justify-content: center; } }
</style>
